tremer-telecom.fr` Let's Encrypt certificate bundle for Postfix / STARTTLS.\n   * **Read-Only Reconnaissance**: Inspect the current Postfix/Dovecot configuration, existing TLS cert expiration, disk usage, or journal logs.\n\nHow shall we proceed?","thinking":"**Confirming Port and Server Details**\n\nThe target server `mtq-mailsrvp-01`, identified as a Martinique mail server (prod), is listening on port 30. A recent merge in the version control history bundles TLS configurations related to `postfix.outremer-telecom.fr`, which may be relevant. The IP address is `172.30.39.153` and the user is `superuser`.\n\n\n"}
